   "notes": "The table defines V01 = 7.093(8) cm^3/mol and pressure uncertainty as 3% of measured pressure. Blank c/a entries are retained as missing. The EOS in Table 3 is a combined fit to these data plus earlier hcp-Fe measurements from Jephcoat et al. (1986a,b) and Mao et al. (1967).",
